  "description": "The urge to experience new things. With our ALLMTN 7, that feeling is firmly rooted in the design. An eMTB for uncompromising performance on the trail. Uphill and downhill. In the high mountains and in the forest. For spontaneous jumps and fat drops. The compact yet ultra-strong Yamaha PW-X3 motor masters every obstacle with its enormous power. With the 720Wh battery, you also have enough range for longer rides. With 160mm travel at the front and rear, high-quality Shimano components and Magura’s MT5 four-piston disc brakes, you’re well-equipped for any adventure. Smooth: the wheel size mix of 29″ at the front and 27.5″ at the rear ensures optimum traction in the uphill and good rollover behaviour in the downhill. The perfect prerequisites for getting more out of your tours in the future – and for experiencing new things.",
